<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News first half net down to A$690 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News first half net down to A$690 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				   690   vs  702</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	1.5   vs  1.5</p>
<p>    Abnormal		    loss 41.0   vs  39.0 profit</p>
<p>NOTE: The News Corporation Ltd is a global media and entertainment group.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		     807  vs 722</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		     7.06  vs 6.78</p>
<p>    Other income		    loss 296  vs loss 305</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    22.0 vs 22.0</p>
<p>    Tax					67   v  61</p>
<p>Geographic results by sales in latest half:</p>
<p>				(A$ million)</p>
<p>				     1996		    1995</p>
<p>    United States	     4,936		   4,741</p>
<p>    United Kingdom	    1,274		   1,187</p>
<p>    Australasia		   852		     851</p>
<p>Geographic results by operating income in latest half:</p>
<p>				     1996	     1995</p>
<p>    United States		 635     vs     607</p>
<p>    United Kingdom		212     vs     173</p>
<p>    Australasia		    49     vs	49</p>
<p>Industry results based on sales in latest half:</p>
<p>    Newspapers		   1,525    vs    1,538</p>
<p>    Magazines and inserts	710    vs	797</p>
<p>    Television		   1,736    vs    1,720</p>
<p>    Filmed entertainment     2,150    vs    1,749</p>
<p>    Book publishing		511    vs	707</p>
